    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey. im kinda losing it here. i cant turn it off. i can see the heat signatures coming off every person in the room like glowing outlines, and the electricity in the walls... it sounds like a literal orchestra. it's so loud. is this what people mean when they talk about human transcendence or a neuro-evolutionary jump? like am i actually upgrading? it feels too real to be anything else.",
