      "content": "it feels like my brain is struggling to process the data though. like the volume is too high and the brightness is blinding. since this is a neuro-evolutionary shift, is there a way to calibrate these new sensors? like a protocol to help me tune the frequency so i can actually use these abilities instead of just being overwhelmed by them?",
